{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"AMO","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"阿摩司書","commonName":"阿摩司書","title":"阿摩司書","order":30,"numberOfChapters":9,"sha256":"5606ff53dbf6d121dcf5f38beb3bd015c6c14b0f2915d7372d34815a7afdda23","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":9,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","totalNumberOfVerses":146},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["預言以色列的毀滅"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"在錫安生活安逸舒適的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在撒瑪利亞山上自覺無憂的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們有禍了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們是列國之首以色列的顯要，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列人都仰望你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們去甲尼看看，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然後從那裡到哈瑪大城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再到非利士人的迦特看看。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們比這些國家更好嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的領土不比你們的更廣闊嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們以為災難的日子離得還遠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就大肆施行暴政。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們躺在象牙床上，閒靠在臥榻上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們吃養在圈裡的肥嫩牛羊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們伴著琴聲唱慵懶的歌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像大衛一樣為自己製造樂器。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們以大碗狂飲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用上等膏油抹身，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻漠不關心約瑟家的衰亡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，你們要首先被擄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的宴樂將從此消逝！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之上帝——主耶和華憑自己起誓說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我憎惡雅各的驕傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"厭棄他的城堡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把城和城中的一切都交給敵人。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["那時，如果一棟房子裡剩下十人，這十人也要死亡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["親屬抬出屍體焚燒時，必問內屋的人：「你那裡還有別人嗎？」那人必回答：「沒有。」問的人必說：「不要作聲，我們不可提耶和華的名。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"看啊，耶和華一聲令下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大屋頓成瓦礫，小房化為碎片。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"馬能在懸崖上奔馳嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牛能在海中耕作嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們卻使公正淪為毒藥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使公義之果變成苦艾。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們炫耀自己征服了羅底巴，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吹噓憑自己的能力奪取了加寧。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬軍之上帝耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「以色列家啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使一個國家興起攻擊你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從哈馬口直至亞拉巴河，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要到處欺壓你們。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}